# Zerem — Hindi.
#
# Written by hand, not generated. The keys come from the `@tr()` calls in the
# `.slint` files; a `msgid` that does not match the original exactly falls back
# to English, silently — so editing a string in the `.slint` means editing here
# too.
#
# The sentences Rust composes (states, units, causes of failure) are not here:
# they live in `zerem-core/src/text/catalogue.rs`, for the reason given there.
